<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="S7.T1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">TABLE I</span>: </span><span id="S7.T1.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Training Loss Comparison of FedLLM and DPFedLLM after 200 Communication Rounds (<math id="S7.T1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\varepsilon" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>ε</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math> = 25.0, Clip = 0.1)</span></figcaption>
