</figure></div></div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S7.F6.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Fig. 6</span>: </span><span id="S7.F6.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Expectation <math id="S7.F6.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbb{E}[\tilde{\Delta}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mover accent="true"><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo mathsize="1.110em">~</mo></mover><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbb{E}[\tilde{\Delta}]</annotation></semantics></math> and Variance <math id="S7.F6.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathrm{Var}[\tilde{\Delta}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>Var</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mover accent="true"><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo mathsize="1.110em">~</mo></mover><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathrm{Var}[\tilde{\Delta}]</annotation></semantics></math> of Noisy Updates in Our DP-FedLoRA over training rounds with Different Base Models and Fixed LoRA Rank</span></figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="S7.T4" class="ltx_table">
